OL,3,GNEWSAMobile phone ban having an impact
OL,4,Aon schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeachers and pupils say the ban on
OL,7,Fmobile phones in schools is having a
OL,8,Fnoticeable impact.
OL,10,FIt was introduced in June across all
OL,11,Fschools in England and Alsager School
OL,12,Fin Cheshire asks students to seal their
OL,13,Fphones in pouches until it is time to
OL,14,Fgo home.
OL,16,FHeadteacher Andrea O'Neill said the
OL,17,Fresponse had been "really good", and
OL,18,Fthe school had become noisier with
OL,19,Fchildren talking to each other again.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
