OL,3,GNEWSAMobile phone ban having an impact
OL,4,Aon schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne pupil, Rose, said: "Everyone's a
OL,7,Fbit more sociable, so straight away in
OL,8,Fthe morning instead of sitting on your
OL,9,Fphone everyone's talking and getting
OL,10,Fready for the day."
